Third-party dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Pyoneer depends on, but does not bundle, the following. Install them from
requirements.txt; their own licences govern their use.

  pygame        LGPL-2.1-or-later      https://www.pygame.org/
  pytmx (PyTMX) LGPL-3.0-or-later      https://github.com/bitcraft/pytmx

Neither is redistributed here. Note that both are LGPL: linking to them from
Apache-2.0 code is fine, but if you redistribute a build that bundles them,
their terms apply to those components.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Art and other assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party art is included in this repository, deliberately. The engine
reads image files at runtime that you must supply yourself. See docs/ASSETS.md
for what is required and tools/make_placeholder_art.py for generated stand-ins.

The Apache-2.0 licence above covers the SOURCE CODE of this engine. It says
nothing about art, audio, maps or other content you load into it -- those carry
whatever licence their author gave them, and that is your responsibility to
check. In particular, art shipped with a commercial game-making tool is
commonly licensed for use inside that tool's projects only and not for
redistribution.

